cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LLM Sandbox"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight and portable sandbox environment designed to run Large Language
  Model (LLM) generated code in a safe and isolated mode. It provides a secure
  execution environment for AI-generated code with pluggable container backends
  (Docker, Podman, Kubernetes, Micromamba), configurable security policies,
  multi-language support, automatic artifact extraction, container pooling, and
  a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
